APPLICABILITY

RFC 9382 uses the IRTF alternate document stream. The applicable Trust Legal
Provisions are the policy effective March 25, 2015. Section 8.c addresses the
alternate-stream treatment of the section-3 licenses. Section 8.g explicitly
excludes the section-4 code-component BSD grant for IRTF documents. No BSD
grant is asserted for this RFC's material.

The complete official policy body, with HTML formatting and navigation
removed, is retained in TLP-2015-REFERENCE.txt. That reference also includes
rules for other streams; those rules do not become grants for this material.
